### Find Medication by Barcode (CIP13 or CIP7)
# Example using Doliprane 1000mg (CIP13: 3400935165809)
GET https://api.open-medicaments.fr/api/v1/medicaments?query=3400935165809&limit=1

###
# The response from above gives us a codeCIS.
# Example CIS from Doliprane 1000mg: 60234100
# NOTE: The first API might return a slightly different structure, check the response "codeCIS" field.

### Get Medication Details by CIS
# Using the CIS code found from the previous request (e.g., 60234100)
GET https://medicaments-api.giygas.dev/medicament/id/69309629
